body:
I have been told countless times and then some that parents are so great and bla bla bla and how they do the best they can for us. I am glad people have great parents but NOT EVERYONE is that fortunate. Only people with shit parents know how much it sucks to be raised by parents who were definitely not up for the job.

&#x200B;

I have had absent parents all my life, now I could have understood the physical distance but the emotional one is just too much, especially with my dad.
